+a bounded complex functional. The existence of a representing measure is separate. -/
+theorem theorem_6_19_norm (c : ComplexMeasure X) [c.variation.Regular]
+    (Φ : ZeroAtInftyContinuousMap X ℂ →L[ℂ] ℂ)
